      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend salon owner Khaled and the grooming staff for their warm welcomes and attentive customer service. Reviewers note that staff take time to discuss individual coat care needs and sensitive skin concerns before each appointment. Pet owners appreciate the personalized attention shown during every visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
