      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat haircuts and fresh coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight tidy cuts, clean trims, and soft coats that smell fresh long after grooming. Owners of doodles, schnauzers, Pomeranians, and maltipoos report that haircuts accurately match requested styles. Reviewers also praise gentle dematting work that restores healthy fur without causing discomfort."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for timid pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably their dogs handle appointments at the salon, even when visiting for their very first groom. Multiple clients note that anxious and sensitive pets leave energetic and cheerful without signs of stress. Pet parents appreciate that staff members treat every animal with genuine care."
      }
    }
